WEBVTT

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:34.950
<i>Yu Yu</i>

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:34.950
<i>Hakusho</i>

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>In a crowded city, as I bump shoulders, I'm all alone.</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:49.750
<i>On an endless prairie, as the wind whistles by, I'm all alone.</i>

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:57.760
<i>Which one is it that makes me want to cry more, I wonder.</i>

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:04.770
<i>Marking it with twin circles, I feel a bit more grown-up!</i>

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>It must be, that when I run into these terribly difficult walls,</i>

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.150
<i>and unexpectedly, for whatever reason,</i>

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:20.870
<i>the courage and power to break through rises up from within.</i>

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:28.170
<i>All because of how, when I run into these terribly difficult people,</i>

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:35.710
<i>they show me kindness, I bet!</i>

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:40.050
<i>Thank you very much!</i>

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.320
Yusuke!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.620
Forget it!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:03.950
There's no way you guys can win.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.910
That's right. It's hot enough already.

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.040
Shut up!

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:11.380
Once we get rid of you, this town will belong to us!

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.180
Let's beat them up!

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.720
No choice then. Let's do it quick.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:19.890
Yusuke!

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.760
Big trouble! Big trouble!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.350
Hey, you! Watch out!

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:26.440
Big trouble!

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.450
What's with you? Watch out next time!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.200
Just follow me.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.280
In any case, it's real big trouble!

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:45.410
Listen you... we're busy
enjoying our summer vacation.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:48.370
If it's an order from Lord
Koenma, I'm not listening!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:51.500
But Lord Koenma has been kidnapped!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.090
Lord Koenma has been what?

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:07.390
Hey, If you keep crying, we
can't figure out what happened.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.850
Talk to us.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.030
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:15.900
Lord Koenma wanted to
have a cool summer vacation.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.900
He's not cool.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.870
<i>So</i> he brought us all to Death Sea Beach.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:37.420
It's just like heaven but with lots of bikinis.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.770
After taking a nap, the master was
playing the watermelon breaking game.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:42.770
Where is it?

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.820
My name is Garuga.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.270
I am taking Lord Koenma.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:04:00.660
If you want him back, bring the
Golden Seal to Magma Valley by sunset.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.910
If you don't, Lord Koenma will die!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.670
It was just so unexpected.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.880
What's the Golden Seal?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:18.220
Um...

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.140
Found it!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.640
This is King Enma's Golden Seal.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.900
It must not be taken from here.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:39.160
It is proof that he
controls the Spirit World.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:45.620
If someone else should get their
hands on it, there would be chaos!

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.700
There would be no order at all!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.980
Even King Enma himself could
be thrown out of the Spirit World.

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.540
So they want this seal in
exchange for Lord Koenma's life?

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:00.260
How can we take the Seal while
King Enma is away on his business trip?

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.720
But if we don't...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.140
I don't know what to do...

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:14.070
He's such an annoying brat.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.550
Yusuke, wait!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.810
Yusuke, you can't.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.490
But if we don't bring it
along, we can't save Lord Koenma

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.990
I don't like it, but if I come
back with both the Golden Seal...

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.170
...and Lord Koenma, there
shouldn't be any problems, right?

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:33.580
We don't have much time.
Botan, you'll have to guide us.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.160
Sure thing! Let's hurry.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:40.050
Hey, where's Hiei?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.510
He was just here.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:49.560
He's such a cold fish. But don't
worry, I'll rescue poor Lord Koenma.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.220
No problem!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:56.020
That's right! We need
to ask for Kurama's help.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:25.750
Your stupid servants are
leaving the Gate of Judgment.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.680
Who's there?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.640
Have you forgotten me?

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.310
Koashura!

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:36.520
Hey, Garuga.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.860
Yes, master Koashura.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:42.980
What are you going to do with me?

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:48.950
Well, I'm going to take over your
position at the Gate of Judgment.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.910
What!

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:58.300
Once I get the Golden Seal, I'm
going to use it on lots of papers!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.040
There's gonna be trouble.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.290
Trouble! Not trouble! Please don't do it!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.790
If my dad, King Enma, finds out
that the Golden Seal was stolen...

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:09.880
...it's going to be a lot
worse than just trouble!

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:19.150
That crumbling rock
should be okay until sunset.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:32.330
If the Golden Seal isn't here by
then, you'll go right into the magma!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:41.790
Hurry, hurry!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.050
Hey, what are you doing?

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.810
Who are you guys?

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:06.810
This is the evil demon
family's land. We can't let you pass.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.480
We don't have the time to
play with you guys right now.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.320
See ya!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:20.240
I heard that you have
King Enma's Golden Seal.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.210
What?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.710
Give it to us!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.100
Urameshi!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.940
We don't have time! Run, Kuwabara!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.930
Shotgun!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.070
Yusuke!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:31.570
I wonder if your loyal
servants can really make it here?

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.370
What! Did you do something to them?

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:37.490
I'm not telling.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.570
What? Why you!

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.580
Koashura!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:44.080
Hot!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.880
Hot!

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.670
You idiot, don't throw it over here!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:54.130
Why are you doing this to me?

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:57.470
Ask yourself!

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.260
What?

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:02.230
You were <i>so</i> mean to me!

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:05.520
This my revenge.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.330
Hey Kuwabara...

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:22.330
How do you think those guys
knew we had the Golden Seal?

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.590
It's too <i>soon</i> for rumors to start.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.090
I guess we've fallen
into the trap already.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.510
If so...

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.510
Botan, watch out!

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:41.590
Kuwabara!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:43.730
What is this thing?

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.770
A Rock Tree Monster!

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:47.970
Yusuke, over there!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.950
Give me the Golden Seal!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.780
Spirit Gun!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.250
What!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.460
You creep!

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:12.120
I've got the treasure!

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.880
Give it back!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.510
Botan!

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.390
I've got you!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.230
That cage can regenerate itself.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:30.170
I will start with the woman!

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.350
Take this!

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.360
Botan!

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:43.410
Who is that getting in my way?

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:47.460
We can handle a half-rotten tree.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:48.590
Kurama!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.210
Hiei! You're here, too!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:04.250
I just can't leave you guys
alone if the Golden Seal is involved.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.100
Here!

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:10.930
Leave this to us. Get going!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.570
I owe you guys!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.610
Don't let them go!

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.580
We won't let you go any further!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.080
Rose Whip!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.800
Can Yusuke make it in time?

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:41.850
Beats me.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.810
You wouldn't have let him
have it if you didn't think so.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:50.310
Then don't ask!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:58.860
Hey, the sun is setting! Run faster!

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:01.490
You idiot! This is as fast as I can go!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.410
They're back again!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.370
What do we do now?

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.750
We've got to get through!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.630
All right!

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.340
Who do you think I am?

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:28.560
You have a problem with me?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.570
Magma Valley is over there.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.020
We're not gonna make it!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.160
Urameshi, hang on!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.580
Grow, Spirit Sword!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.830
Go, Urameshi!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.300
Help me!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:10.300
Hey, if we don't help Lord
Koenma soon, he'll really die.

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:14.470
What are you talking about?
We should just let him die.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.470
What?

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.730
It's their fault if they
can't make it in time.

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:21.730
Yeah, but...

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.740
Hold it!

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.200
We brought the Golden Seal!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.460
Yusuke!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.200
Release Lord Koenma now!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.590
Hey, Garuga! Let him go.

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:53.680
Okay, throw the Golden Seal over here.

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:55.720
Here.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.570
This is King Enma's Golden Seal.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:08.690
Finally, I've done it!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:11.370
Koenma is finished!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.210
I will make you a bus
boy for the rest of your life.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.630
It's the Golden Seal... the real one!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.920
Hey Garuga! What are you doing?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.680
This Golden Seal is mine!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.930
What did you say?

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:34.690
The Spirit World is
now under my control!

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.180
Why don't you obey my orders?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.610
I don't need you any longer!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.950
You ugly goat-face, you
planned this all along, didn't you?

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.820
Give us back the Golden Seal!

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.450
You want to take it from me?

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.750
I'll get you with one shot!

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.750
Spirit Gun!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.670
Did I do it?

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:12.180
Yusuke!

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:17.010
How do you like your own soul power?

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.150
I can reflect all your
power, <i>so</i> you can't beat me.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.530
That's the demon fugitive, Yasha!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.780
Botan, get Lord Koenma.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:37.120
Get out of my way.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.880
Lord Koenma!

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:49.460
Botan!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:00.980
You evil creature!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:07.560
You can raise your
spirit power with anger.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.410
How's this?

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.580
Take this!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:23.250
I'd compliment you for
fighting with a wounded arm, but...

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.210
It's no use!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.540
Yusuke!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.620
Yusuke!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.710
You don't know your own limitations.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.600
He's over there.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:27.600
What now?

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:30.270
Beneath you is a
bottomless river of magma.

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.070
You want to take a dip?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:34.780
Hiei!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:36.940
Stop!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.170
Stop right there!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.660
Unbelievable!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:52.290
He can stand up
after taking my attacks.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:56.680
Why are you
sacrificing your life for this kid?

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:02.430
He's the one
who brought me back to life.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:03.980
Yusuke!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.690
So, you owe him your life now?

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:12.730
In any case, I can't let
you take the Golden Seal.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:15.910
Let's help them now.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.200
You stubborn fool!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.410
I will blow you away!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.740
This is the end!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.970
Spirit Gun!

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:38.760
You fool!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:45.060
Die!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:49.930
What!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.320
Yusuke!

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.650
Did we do it?

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:07.290
No, it's not over.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:14.840
You' re playing dirty!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.880
But don't underestimate me.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.760
It didn't work!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.890
You'll pay for that!

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.940
This is the last of my power!

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:38.160
Die!

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.820
Take a look at your body!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.070
What? The magma is hardening...

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:47.460
Take this! Spirit Gun!

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.590
Urameshi!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.300
We did it!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:05.180
Yusuke!

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.350
Yusuke!

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:11.180
Botan!

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.030
The Golden Seal!

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:41.710
When we get back to the Gate
of Judgment, I'll take care of you.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:42.640
Okay.

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:49.390
Koashura, why did
you plan this conspiracy?

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:51.690
You said something about revenge.

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:56.820
Hey, we don't feel sorry for you!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.020
But... but...

00:21:59.020 --> 00:22:02.740
When I was going to the Spirit
World kindergarten with Koenma...

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:09.660
...I was going to give
Kotennyo a birthday present.

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:12.870
What did you want
to talk about, Koashura?

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:15.340
Well, actually...

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:18.760
Hi, Kotennyo!

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:21.750
Here is a present for you!

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:25.220
Oh, thank you, Koenma.

00:22:30.220 --> 00:22:33.220
I will have my revenge one day!

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:37.230
What? This was all over a kids fight?

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:39.070
But...

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:41.610
You're such a troublemaker.

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:45.450
You would have done the same!

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:51.660
Anyway, we got the
Golden Seal back. Good job!

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:53.990
What happened to little Koashura?

00:22:53.990 --> 00:23:02.300
He got only ten thousand spanks,
because he was under Yasha's influence.

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:05.910
That's no joke, man!

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:14.760
If you hadn't put him in the magma,
who knows what would have happened?

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:18.730
It was just luck.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:22.990
What?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:24.770
Just luck?

00:23:24.770 --> 00:23:28.870
Hey, hey. It worked out all right, didn't it?

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.780
That's not funny!

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.910
Yusuke!

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:37.540
Oh, I have a date.
I've gotta run. See ya!

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:40.340
Hey! Hold it, Yusuke!

00:23:54.840 --> 00:24:01.180
<i>As my heart is about to burst,</i>

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:08.190
<i>the mild wind that blows against us is gentle</i>

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:13.490
<i>Facing each other, hand in hand,</i>

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:20.500
<i>the usual twilight envelops us and melts away</i>

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:26.500
<i>Isn't it funny? They're not even the slightest bit alike,</i>

00:24:26.500 --> 00:24:32.840
<i>your smiling face, and mine</i>

00:24:32.840 --> 00:24:39.510
<i>But right now, it feels like I'm looking in a mirror</i>

00:24:39.510 --> 00:24:45.850
<i>I am not feeling sad; everything is fine, after all</i>

00:24:45.850 --> 00:24:52.150
<i>There, hiding within an offhanded greeting, lies a "thank you"</i>

00:24:52.150 --> 00:24:57.450
<i>Sayonara, bye bye, take care of yourself</i>

00:24:58.490 --> 00:25:00.990
<i>This is the line I'm drawing between us,</i>

00:25:00.990 --> 00:25:04.910
<i>so catch it, if you would</i>

00:25:04.910 --> 00:25:12.050
